Example on how to compile CUDA projects with PandaRoot.


#### USING IT ####
Either copy the whole /tutorials/cuda directory into your /pandaroot/ dir and add
	add_subdirectory (cuda)
to the /pandaroot/CMakeLists.txt or just add 
	add_subdirectory (tutorials/cuda)
to the .txt. Also, add
  if(isLibrary("libPndCuda"))gSystem->Load("libPndCuda");
to your $VMCWORKDIR/gconfig/rootlogon.C, if your still using the rootlogon.C method.

`cmake` and `make` and you should be done.

#### MORE INFO ####
Some more detailed explanation is available at https://github.com/AndiH/CMake/tree/master/CMake%2BCUDA%2BPandaRoot



